00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:22.386
And I'll tell you
something about COVID-19.

00:01:22.386 --> 00:01:26.140
During this time, when
anxiety is an all time high,

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.130
you would think my
practice would be filled

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.114
with patients coming in talking about

00:01:29.114 --> 00:01:30.590
their anxiety and depression.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.660
No, it's patients

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.357
who have never experienced
physical discomfort,

00:01:34.357 --> 00:01:36.920
meaning no aches, no pains, no injuries

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.847
are now having shoulder aches, neck aches,

00:01:38.847 --> 00:01:41.890
backaches, muscle spasms,
and they don't know why.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:44.892
Because your emotions play integral part

00:01:44.892 --> 00:01:47.410
in your physical health,
your mental state,

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.580
your stress levels are all connected

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:50.510
to your physical health.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.370
mind, body. One word.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.920
Not only are we connected from
a neurological standpoint,

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:55.753
meaning that nerves are traveling

00:01:55.753 --> 00:01:57.490
and sending signals through.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:00.253
But we're also connected
through an endocrinological.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:03.550
Why can't I say that,
endocrinological not chronological.

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:07.307
Endocrine system also
connects your mind and body.

00:02:07.307 --> 00:02:08.914
And if you're in a prolonged state

00:02:08.914 --> 00:02:10.660
for a chronic amount of time,

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.355
you can have results in
your physical health.

00:02:12.355 --> 00:02:15.132
Does it matter if you drink
water while standing up

00:02:15.132 --> 00:02:16.593
or sitting down?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:18.833
Does it matter?

