00:02:29.103 --> 00:02:32.320
and I may have given the cornea's joke.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:35.300
Uniquely enough, it does
occur more in women.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.774
So guys out there, she
is not winking at you.

00:02:37.774 --> 00:02:38.607
- Yeah.

00:02:38.607 --> 00:02:40.060
Her eyes just might be twitching.

00:02:41.419 --> 00:02:43.390
I don't think it was funny.
Do you think it was funny?

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.370
Anyway, eye twitch generally harmless

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.120
but some individuals can
be predisposed to it.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.921
Risk factors for developing an eye twitch.

00:02:49.921 --> 00:02:52.560
Stress, obviously so we need to meditate,

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.820
calm down a little bit
more, be more mindful.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.590
Over caffeination. There's
people that are drinking 400,

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:01.210
500 milligrams of
caffeine in their coffees.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.060
That's too much.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.730
Eye strain from cell phones, computers,

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.470
constantly staring at a screen all day.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.840
do some relaxation exercises.
Take a break every 20 minutes.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.840
And if it's happening quite frequently

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:15.067
and you don't have an answer
as to why it's happening

00:03:15.067 --> 00:03:18.590
and it won't go away or it's really bad

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:19.970
where it interferes with your vision.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.710
That's a reason to go see your doctor,

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.420
'cause there are true conditions out there

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:24.570
that can cause an eye twitch

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.700
that aren't just related
to your lifestyle habits.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:27.891
