00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.430
A procedure I commonly do in the office,

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.040
known as cryotherapy.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.680
It sounds like you're getting in a chamber

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.950
and you're freezing yourself

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.260
but you're not doing that to your body,

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.230
you're just doing it to the wart itself.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.421
In fact, there are some kits

00:03:43.421 --> 00:03:45.061
that are available over the counter

00:03:45.061 --> 00:03:47.190
that you could buy and
do this on your own.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.285
But if you want a sure fire
way to get rid of the warts,

00:03:49.285 --> 00:03:50.365
come into our office.

00:03:50.365 --> 00:03:51.980
Usually it takes a couple of sessions

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.372
to fully get rid of the warts,

00:03:53.372 --> 00:03:55.053
but my patients see great results.

00:03:55.053 --> 00:03:58.100
And it's really rare to
have any adverse effects.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.741
Grace Wisnosky.

00:03:59.741 --> 00:04:02.862
Why do we sweat? Sweating sucks.

00:04:02.862 --> 00:04:07.452
Arrid works, but it's not
the commercial. Sweat stinks.

00:04:07.452 --> 00:04:10.010
Oh, that's an old commercial.
Got a major mishap.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:12.430
It only seems to make me
more hot and uncomfortable.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.660
Well, it certainly makes you uncomfortable

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.528
but it's actually making you
less hot 'cause when you sweat,

00:04:15.528 --> 00:04:18.580
you perspire the water
evaporates off your skin,

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.920
thereby cooling the surface of your skin,

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.290
there by cooling the blood below the skin,

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.780
there by cooling your internal organs

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.920
and you see where I'm going with this?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.860
It's thermo regulation.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.958
If you were to overheat,
you'd be running a fever,

00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:31.220
your body wouldn't be performing optimally

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.830
and you would eventually
die if you didn't sweat.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.210
So thank your pores. Hug them.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.950
Appreciate the moisture
that leaves your body.

