then they can guide you

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.330
and tell you whether or not
you need to see a specialist.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.710
Most reasons patients,
when they come to see me,

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.210
can be treated right then and there.

